<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main class="wrap narrow-text">
  <section class="block prose">
    <h1 class="block-title page-h1">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="muted small">Last updated: 5 October 2026</p>
    <p>This page explains what information <%= settings.site_name %> (“we”) collects when you use this website and how it is used.</p>

    <h2>Information you give us</h2>
    <p>If you create an account we store your username and a securely hashed version of your password. If you post comments, reviews, ratings or reports, or add novels to your library, we store those so they can be shown on the site. We don’t ask for your email address.</p>

    <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cookies we set:</strong> one cookie keeps you logged in and protects forms from misuse. Your theme, reader settings and reading history are saved in your own browser (local storage) and are not sent to us.</li>
      <li><strong>View counts:</strong> we count chapter views to show popularity. We don’t store your IP address with these counts.</li>
      <li><strong>Server logs:</strong> like most websites, our server may briefly keep technical logs (such as IP address and browser type) to keep the site secure and running.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>We use Google AdSense to show ads. Google and its partners use cookies to serve ads based on your previous visits to this and other websites. Google’s use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this site and/or other sites on the Internet.</p>
    <p>You can opt out of personalised advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>, or opt out of some third-party vendors’ use of cookies at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">www.aboutads.info</a>. Learn more in <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</p>
    <% if (settings.ga_id) { %>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site (for example which pages are popular). Google Analytics uses cookies and collects information such as pages visited and approximate location. You can install the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</p>
    <% } %>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can delete cookies and local storage in your browser settings at any time. If you’d like your account and the content you posted removed, contact us and we will delete it.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This site is not directed at children under 13, and we don’t knowingly collect information from them.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with a new date.</p>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
